"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She doesn't swim in winter, so her tanlines are gone, and her hair grew longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's no longer reluctant in bodily contact, and couldn't forget the days with you back in summer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2606H Scenes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy 3 kinds of H scenes throught out the game: HCG, H animation and pixel H animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289580/extras/aa373d897b866f57768d2d9547f3eecd.avif?t=1748510903\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289580/extras/33a0210a61da40b85aabcc7cdc42de6f.poster.avif?t=1748510903\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289580/extras/33a0210a61da40b85aabcc7cdc42de6f.webm?t=1748510903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289580/extras/33a0210a61da40b85aabcc7cdc42de6f.mp4?t=1748510903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289580/extras/ad0f255067feff62ebc4566f4c037f44.poster.avif?t=1748510903\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289580/extras/ad0f255067feff62ebc4566f4c037f44.webm?t=1748510903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289580/extras/ad0f255067feff62ebc4566f4c037f44.mp4?t=1748510903\